 "004.png", "id": "717772666074001", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974460_717772669407334_7411742698121570967_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E22p7ltvAuEQ7kNvwE6M559&_nc_oc=AdolgvbsENuC3vJ_q0Bnx8jaqDYRWpjeQ413300nO_1rlIPqAG7S4GBYc0I7LGAZ2hQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTYQdgw5_SU24nLP7m1mHpOCxlR_0JE7lD2OGwy0Htjw&oe=6A8D8FB9"}, {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "508206964108473", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86613167_508206967441806_5947248506887917381_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GfFZ3hi2xRIQ7kNvwEf5p74&_nc_oc=Ado8UKCA06rmnEqcbuXy07yS3G2L1jD_F63d-muUhKMlQzoNzp39GeYw6H6sP4P_0X8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFZBGd-zMYK2wUm_bOLEBjNL7YgTXTdBKTqaBcfmvHWfA&oe=6A8D83A1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "QPP_WorldofMechs_2560x1440.png", "id": "275784341430859", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974610_275784344764192_1043956551782677645_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_lTET7tBVtgQ7kNvwH3s6P9&_nc_oc=Adp4bziqITXCh59gyYsnX-bYpMjkXxxTZRK8byngYgo04synQHf7m3PUx8vzSpoaUi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHgySM2uLR71SsJaWbR6_Cb3pUN4L2SUY0LLX0MKITkbA&oe=6A8D81A8"}, "display_name": "World Of Mechs", "keywords": ["Action", "Mechs", "Multiplayer", "Shooter", "Deathmatch"], "long_description": "Strap in and get ready for heart-pumping mech battlin\u2019 VR action! World of Mechs is the only online competitive squad-based VR mech game that delivers the feeling of thrashing across city blocks in a 10-ton robotic war machine while launching a salvo of missiles on the opposition. Feel the adrenaline rush of leading a flanking charge with weapons ablaze and jump-jets engaged. Blast off into the single-player campaign to take down menacing bosses and become the world\u2019s most-feared ace pilot.\n\nONLINE ONSLAUGHT: Dive into the multiplayer VR arena with 3 friends to battle online foes on five maps in 4 modes.\n\nCOMBAT STYLES: Select from 32 mechs across 8 different class types to fit your combat style. Use special abilities to jam radar sensors, deploy landmines, and enable stealth cloaking.\n\nSINGLE-PLAYER: Earn cash for upgrades and learn winning tactics in Campaign Mode.\n\nBUILT FOR QUEST 2: Headset Targeting System and VR visual performance optimizations customized to enhance gameplay.", "short_description": "Strap in and get ready for heart-pumping mech battlin\u2019 VR action! World of Mechs is the only online competitive squad-based VR mech game that delivers the feeling of thrashing across city blocks in a 10-ton robotic war machine while launching a salvo of missiles on the opposition. Feel the adrenaline rush of leading a flanking charge with weapons ablaze and jump-jets engaged. Blast off into the single-player campaign to take down menacing bosses and become the world\u2019s most-feared ace pilot."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.369.fun/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Studio 369 Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://worldofmechs.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "672665650577286"}}]}, "schedul